## 👨‍💻 About The Project

This repository contains my **personal developer portfolio**, created to build a professional online presence and showcase my technical skills, projects, achievements, and development journey.

The portfolio is designed with a clean and responsive interface so that recruiters, developers, and potential collaborators can quickly understand my background and explore the projects I have built.

### 🎯 Goals

* Build a professional developer identity online
* Showcase technical skills and projects
* Provide an easy way for recruiters to explore my work
* Practice modern frontend development
* Create a responsive experience across different screen sizes
* Continuously improve the portfolio as I learn new technologies

---

## ✨ Features

* 🎨 **Modern & Clean UI**
* 📱 **Fully Responsive Design**
* 💻 **Developer Profile & Introduction**
* 🛠️ **Technical Skills Showcase**
* 🚀 **Projects Portfolio**
* 📜 **Certifications & Achievements**
* 📞 **Contact Section**
* ⚡ **Smooth Animations & Transitions**
* 🌐 **Live Deployment**
* 📂 **Separate Frontend & Backend Structure**

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

### Frontend

| Technology | Purpose                            |
| ---------- | ---------------------------------- |
| HTML5      | Website structure                  |
| CSS3       | Styling and responsive design      |
| JavaScript | Interactivity and dynamic behavior |

### Backend

The repository also contains a dedicated `backend` directory for backend-related functionality.

### Deployment

* **Frontend:** Netlify
* **Backend:** Backend deployment/configuration as implemented in the project

---

## 📂 Project Structure

```text
portfolio/
│
├── backend/
│   └── Backend source code
│
├── frontend/
│   └── Frontend source code
│
├── README.md
│
└── ...
```

The project is organized into separate frontend and backend components to keep the application modular and easier to maintain.

