## ⚙️ Getting Started

Follow these steps to run the project locally.

### 1. Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/Kiran-Rathod-R/portfolio.git
```

### 2. Navigate to the Project

```bash
cd portfolio
```

### 3. Open the Frontend

Navigate into the frontend directory:

```bash
cd frontend
```

Open the project using your preferred IDE or code editor.

If the frontend is a static HTML/CSS/JavaScript application, you can open the main HTML file directly in a browser or use a local development server.

### 4. Backend Setup

Navigate to the backend directory:

```bash
cd ../backend
```

Follow the backend configuration requirements defined by the project.

